  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br>매일 눈팅만 하고 자료만 퍼가서 쓰다가.. 처음으로 올려봅니다..^^&nbsp; ..소리는 안나요^^:: 쑥쓰러워서..ㅋㅋ </p><p><iframe id=\"v555aqZSErqjvHEKj88ZEcZ\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v555aqZSErqjvHEKj88ZEcZ?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY1NTVhcVpTRXJxanZIRUtqODhaRWNaIiwidGlkIjoiYzc1MzYzMTgtNjA1ZC00MTI0LWIwYzQtMjA3ZmU2YzU5MjExIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgyMDc3fQ.xtxA4LbjN-Yr2I_hgdGRazFlRX59B29QjvqJVtnaMZUBUH2G4ltZfnj2noJFPwzcuk4x4v3A9i3eKFSDOCq5lg&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><iframe id=\"v7c8eqcxu9MuaUjC9DDj9SM\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v7c8eqcxu9MuaUjC9DDj9SM?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY3YzhlcWN4dTlNdWFVakM5RERqOVNNIiwidGlkIjoiZDI1Mzc0ZDgtYTI4NC00YjlmLThhNDQtODJjYjEzYWRiMzdiIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgyMDc3fQ.1nQEaZoI4fr1RTKGuFuSeeJb8tuLzhS5BVqsymfBfRawzP2nRSQ8D-hTiEYmVFiTxayd3FEMiSoIwkYuKNVGGQ&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\